  "text": "How switching from Jira to Linear saved our development team four hours every week. Engineering teams waste Monday mornings dragging tickets across messy columns and updating statuses. Jira's rigid workflows force developers to spend more time documenting tasks than writing production code. Switching to Linear enables automated GitHub PR linking that closes issues directly from terminal commits. You reclaim valuable engineering bandwidth immediately.",
